    "intro_narrative": "The ash storms have finally subsided, revealing the entrance to Sector 7's central bunker. As a scrapper, you've heard legends about this place—it holds the coordinates to the last uncorrupted oasis on Earth. But the facility is dead, its systems fragmented and locked behind layers of post-apocalyptic security measures. You must reactivate the scattered machinery, route power through ancient generators, and bypass the bunker's mainframe to extract the final archives. Time is running out before the radiation levels spike again.",
    "narrative_style": "post_apocalyptic"
  },
